{"doc_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:353963", "version_id": "sha256:f27240ca093ae9f94dfeee96a377c3e0eaf561c3ab9d3ed8f16e557224c60cd3", "chunk_id": "block-0065", "root_unit_id": "block-0065", "unit_type": "article_body", "text": "（四）拟录取结果上报研究生院审核批准，最终录取结果由研究生院进行公示。", "raw_text": "（四）拟录取结果上报研究生院审核批准，最终录取结果由研究生院进行公示。", "clean_text": "（四）拟录取结果上报研究生院审核批准，最终录取结果由研究生院进行公示。", "anchor": {"block_order": 65, "block_role": "paragraph", "parent_heading_path": [], "source_uri": "campusnotice://muc_internal_portal/notice/353963", "link_target": null}, "metadata": {"block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null}}
